          "relevance": 0.504,
          "lineage": "verbatim",
          "injection_risk": "untrusted_content",
          "body": "The Team plan costs $9 per member per month billed annually, or $11 billed monthly. It adds unlimited projects, 100 GB of storage, guests, recurring tasks, the Slack and GitHub integrations, and email support that replies within one business day."
        },
