          "lineage": "verbatim",
          "injection_risk": "untrusted_content",
          "body": "The Business plan costs $19 per member per month billed annually, or $23 billed monthly. It includes everything in Team, plus SAML single sign-on, SCIM provisioning, an audit log, a 99.9% uptime SLA, data residency in the EU or the US, 1 TB of storage, and priority support that replies within 4 hours."
